# Go To's list paged with its arrows, on the test book (tools/e2e.zig plays it). Start
# from a fresh test folder: noface on its library, the book not opened before. Twelve
# pages are bookmarked, one more than the list's 11 rows (ui/goto.zig `rows`), so the
# twelfth bookmark is alone on the list's second page. Where a row jumps to is read
# from the turn after it: "turn to 13:" is the turn from page 12.

# Opening the book from the library's hero
tap library.hero
log screen: Reader opened
drawn 600
still

# Page 1 bookmarked, then on to page 2
tap page.top
drawn 200
still
tap toolbar.bookmark
log bookmark added
drawn 200
still
tap toolbar.close
drawn 200
still
tap page.forward
log turn to 2:
drawn 500
still

# Page 2 bookmarked, then on to page 3
tap page.top
drawn 200
still
tap toolbar.bookmark
log bookmark added
drawn 200
still
tap toolbar.close
drawn 200
still
tap page.forward
log turn to 3:
drawn 500
still

# Page 3 bookmarked, then on to page 4
tap page.top
drawn 200
still
tap toolbar.bookmark
log bookmark added
drawn 200
still
tap toolbar.close
drawn 200
still
tap page.forward
log turn to 4:
drawn 500
still

# Page 4 bookmarked, then on to page 5
tap page.top
drawn 200
still
tap toolbar.bookmark
log bookmark added
drawn 200
still
tap toolbar.close
drawn 200
still
tap page.forward
log turn to 5:
drawn 500
still

# Page 5 bookmarked, then on to page 6
tap page.top
drawn 200
still
tap toolbar.bookmark
log bookmark added
drawn 200
still
tap toolbar.close
drawn 200
still
tap page.forward
log turn to 6:
drawn 500
still

# Page 6 bookmarked, then on to page 7
tap page.top
drawn 200
still
tap toolbar.bookmark
log bookmark added
drawn 200
still
tap toolbar.close
drawn 200
still
tap page.forward
log turn to 7:
drawn 500
still

